Both ReviewResult blocks carry verdict `APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS`. Addressing the two conditions inline via `poe:task:update` now.

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t11","description":"Execute must-not compliance audit against all 16 MN constraints (MN-SEC-01, MN-SEC-02, MN-SEC-03, MN-PRIV-01, MN-PRIV-02, MN-PRIV-03, MN-TRUST-01, MN-TRUST-02, MN-TRUST-03, MN-ARCH-01, MN-ARCH-02, MN-ARCH-03, MN-SCOPE-01, MN-SCOPE-02, MN-QG-01, MN-QG-02). Note: must-nots.md overview states '14 constraints' but enumerates 16 distinct identifiers — audit against the full enumerated list, not the stated count. Verification methods: Network tab (MN-SEC-01), source inspection for CDN refs (MN-SEC-02), source scan for eval/innerHTML-with-input (MN-SEC-03), DevTools Application storage (MN-PRIV-01), source for analytics/beacon (MN-PRIV-02), source for console/fetch with guess strings (MN-PRIV-03), gameplay test with invalid guess (MN-TRUST-01), DOM inspection mid-game (MN-TRUST-02), two-guess target verification (MN-TRUST-03), package.json + HTML imports (MN-ARCH-01), file:// open test (MN-ARCH-02), no server files present (MN-ARCH-03), no auth forms (MN-SCOPE-01), no date-based logic (MN-SCOPE-02), console during full game in each browser (MN-QG-01), duplicate-letter gameplay test (MN-QG-02). artifactType: test. estimatedHours: 2. acceptanceCriteria: All 16 MN identifiers listed above marked PASS; any FAIL is a blocker before t12 review."}
```

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t6","description":"Implement renderRow(rowIndex, scoreResults) performing two distinct operations per tile: (a) tile.textContent = letter — sets the letter character, uses textContent not innerHTML per MN-SEC-03; (b) tile.classList.add('correct' | 'present' | 'absent') — applies color state via CSS class toggling, NOT via textContent. Color classes 'correct', 'present', 'absent' must be defined in t1 (HTML skeleton) or t9 (CSS) before this task is marked done — verify their existence before implementing. The implementing agent must confirm CSS classes are present before closing this task. artifactType: code. estimatedHours: 1. acceptanceCriteria: Green tiles rendered for 'correct' results; yellow for 'present'; gray for 'absent'; textContent used for letter assignment (MN-SEC-03 satisfied); classList used for color state; CSS color classes (.correct, .present, .absent) verified present in the file set."}
```

```json
{"poe":"done","summary":"Stage 1 plan created, reviewed, and approved. 3 Epics, 9 Features, 12 Tasks, 19 dependency edges. Senior engineer returned APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Two conditions addressed via poe:task:update: (1) t11 acceptance criteria now enumerates all 16 MN identifiers explicitly (resolves stated-count vs enumerated-count discrepancy in must-nots.md); (2) t6 description now clearly distinguishes textContent assignment (letter content, MN-SEC-03) from classList manipulation (color state) and requires CSS class existence verification before close. Plan is ready for execution."}
```

